T*
() Tj
T*
(Proposed method) Tj
T*
(A full-covariance Gaussian mixture models the joint distribution of the) Tj
T*
(three log-transformed counters. For each counter, calculate its conditional) Tj
T*
(negative log likelihood given the other two counters. Average the three) Tj
T*
(conditional scores for the final anomaly score. This pseudo-likelihood) Tj
T*
(measures whether each counter is consistent with the clean relationships) Tj
T*
(learned from the other counters. Select mixture size by BIC on fitting data.) Tj
T*
